## 8. Review checklist (for the reviewer)

Use this when sanity-checking the tutorial against the code:

- [ ] Plugin arg names match `qemu_plugin/hybrid_handoff.c`
      (`outfile`, `enter_pc`).
- [ ] vsim flag names match `src/main.cpp` in the external vsim checkout
      (`--resume-from-qemu`, `--handoff-out`, `--hybrid-exit-pc`,
      `--shared-mem-{path,size,base}`).
- [ ] The 2 modes are marker and PC; the end-of-program exit is described
      as the run tail, not as a mode.
- [ ] marker/pc document the kernel cycle figure as the vsim `mcycle` delta
      (offset 624).
- [ ] `mcycle`/`minstret` offsets (624 / 632) match
      `include/hybrid/state_abi.h` and `tests/e2e.sh`.
- [ ] The suite runs via `scripts/run_e2e.sh`, NOT via a CTest
      `switching-mode` label.
